Subject: [PATCH 0062] drm-kmod: checkpoints in the modeset commit (applied to drm-kmod, after 0060)

nmx_trace before each statement-level call in intel_atomic_commit_tail, skl_commit_modeset_enables and
hsw_crtc_enable, never inside a spinlock/irq-off region (nmxtrace=3 writes NVRAM, which may sleep). Off unless the
boot argument nmxtrace is set. Noisy once WindowServer draws (every commit passes here): a bring-up aid only.

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/i915/display/intel_display.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/i915/display/intel_display.c
